    <color name="serupa_border_brand">#00000000</color> <!-- Alias. A 1px edge just inside a `surface-brand` fill that has no text on it (a checked box, a Switch that's on, a Slider or Progress fill, a dot), for a theme whose fill is under 3:1 on the page: Yellow Light's bright yellow 500 takes a yellow 700 edge (4.9:1 on white, WCAG 1.4.11). Transparent in every other theme, where the fill passes by itself, so nothing is drawn. -->
