    <color name="serupa_surface_highlight">#FF3F3F46</color> <!-- The keyboard-highlighted item in a list: Menu items, Combobox and TimePicker options, the Sidebar's current page. In light the same zinc-100 as `surface-secondary` (about 1.1:1 on `surface`); in dark it shares `surface-secondary`'s zinc-700 (1.7:1 on `surface`, 1.4:1 on `surface-raised`), with no bar by default (`surface-highlight-indicator`). Text on it keeps 4.5:1. -->
