    <color name="serupa_surface_hover">#FF27272A</color> <!-- Alias. A row or item on `surface` under the pointer, a selected row, a striped row (List, Table, InlineEdit): a step off `surface` in every theme (zinc-100 light, the same as `surface-highlight`; zinc-800 dark). Gray text on it reads `text-secondary`. -->
    <color name="serupa_surface_raised_hover">#FF3F3F46</color> <!-- Alias. A List or InlineEdit row under the pointer or selected on a raised or floating surface (an elevated Card, a Popover, Dialog or Drawer): zinc-100 in light; in dark #333338, a step above zinc-800: zinc-800 and zinc-700 mixed half and half in sRGB (`color-mix(in srgb, zinc-800, zinc-700)`), so it sits between two palette steps rather than adding one, and muted text keeps 4.5:1 on it. Gray text on it reads `text-secondary`. -->
