    <color name="serupa_field_readonly">#FF18181B</color> <!-- Alias. Background of a read-only field: a step flatter than `field` (zinc-100 in light, zinc-900 in dark), so it reads as not editable while its `field-border` still outlines it. The same as `field-disabled`; gray text in it (a placeholder, an affix, a count) reads `text-secondary`, since `field-placeholder` is 4.4:1 on it. -->
