    <color name="serupa_text_disabled">#FFA1A1AA</color> <!-- Alias. The text, icon and mark of anything disabled, in place of fading it: the same neutral in every brand, so a disabled primary, danger or brand control reads as off, never as a faint version of itself. At least 3:1 on `surface-disabled` and the surfaces (4.5:1 with more contrast). -->
