    <color name="serupa_surface_highlight_indicator">#FF3F3F46</color> <!-- The 2px bar at the start of the highlighted item in a dropdown list: Menu items, and Combobox, Select, TimePicker, MentionInput and CommandPalette options. By default it is the same color as `surface-highlight` in every theme (change both together), so no bar shows and the gray fill alone marks the item: under the 3:1 WCAG 1.4.11 asks, a deliberate design choice, as with `field-border`. The item is also the one the screen reader names and the one Enter picks. More contrast (`data-contrast="more"` or the system setting) turns the bar `text`-dark, 3:1+ on `surface-highlight`, and forced colors outline the item in `Highlight`. -->
